## Why This Question Is Asked
Tests ability to design a privacy-aware, multi-stage pipeline with governance and cross-account considerations.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven architecture; S3 event filtering; Transcribe with diarization; Comprehend PII redaction; SageMaker multi-task inference; DynamoDB composite keys; KMS encryption; Glue lineage; DLQ design; cross-account IAM trust policies.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Orchestrator triggered on S3 PUT event
async function handle(event) {
  const { bucket, key } = event.Records[0].s3;
  const callId = extractCallId(key);
  const transcribeJob = await startTranscribe(bucket, key, callId);
  await pollUntilComplete(transcribeJob.JobId, onTranscribeComplete);
}
```

