- Robust error handling: Dead Letter Queues and retry mechanisms
- Cost management: translate pricing models, storage classes, and request optimization
- IAM least-privilege access patterns
- DynamoDB upsert operations for metadata indexing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Lambda handler for ticket processing
exports.handler = async (event) => {
  const record = event.Records[0];
  const bucket = record.s3.bucket.name;
  const key = record.s3.object.key;

  // Fetch, translate, analyze, store, and index
  const original = await getS3Object(bucket, key);
  const translated = await translateIfNeeded(original);
  const analysis = await analyzeSentiment(translated);
  await storeResults(original, translated);
  await updateDynamoDB(record, analysis);
};
```

